    during the End Phase of this turn, add 1 \"Dark Time Wizard\" from your GY to
    your hand.\r\n\u25CF Toss a coin and call it. If you call it right, destroy as
    many monsters your opponent controls as possible, and if you do, inflict damage
    to your opponent equal to half the combined original ATK of those destroyed monsters.
    If you call it wrong, destroy all monsters you control."
